blocks.text:
You stock shelves and serve customers in your holiday job: {{1}}
The bakery transfers 450 francs in wages to you at the end of the month: {{2}}
A customer is handed two croissants over the counter: {{3}}
The customer pays for the croissants at the till: {{4}}
A hairdressing salon cuts a customer's hair: {{5}}
The customer pays for the haircut by card: {{6}}
A satisfied guest leaves a tip for the waitress at the café: {{7}}
As part of your wages, you are allowed to take leftover loaves home for free in the evening (payment in kind): {{8}}
A family has the sofa they ordered delivered to their home: {{9}}
The family transfers the amount on the invoice to the furniture shop: {{10}}
